Privacy Policy for WizGPT Mobile App

Effective Date: August 1, 2024

1. Introduction

Welcome to WizGPT, a mobile AI assistant application utilizing OpenAI's GPT and DALL-E APIs. We prioritize your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy outlines how we handle your information when you use our app.

2. Information We Collect

2.1 No Data Collection
WizGPT does not collect or store any personal data from its users. We are committed to ensuring that your privacy is fully protected.

2.2 Internet and Microphone Access
To provide the AI assistant services, WizGPT requires access to:

Internet: The app needs an active internet connection to communicate with OpenAI's GPT and DALL-E APIs to generate responses and images.
Microphone: If you choose to use voice commands or interactions, the app requires access to your device's microphone. Audio data is processed in real-time and not stored or collected by WizGPT.
3. How We Use Your Information

Since WizGPT does not collect any personal data, we do not use or share any information for any purposes. The app functions solely by utilizing real-time data processing through internet access and microphone input.

4. Third-Party Services

WizGPT utilizes OpenAI's GPT and DALL-E APIs to provide AI assistant functionalities. While using these services, data processed through the APIs is handled in accordance with OpenAI's privacy policy. WizGPT does not store or retain any data processed through these APIs.

5. Security

We take the security of your interactions with WizGPT seriously. Although we do not collect or store data, we ensure that all communications with OpenAI's services are encrypted and secure.

6. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be effective immediately upon posting the updated Privacy Policy within the app. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.

7. Contact Us

If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at virtualwiz401@gmail.com.

By using WizGPT, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy.
